{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land it Rocket</strong> is a challenging yet accessible 2D rocket-landing game inspired by classic lunar landers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills across <strong>28 carefully crafted levels</strong>, navigating narrow passages, avoiding hazards, and perfecting your landing technique.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores or just want to relax and land safely, there's a mode for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\ude80 28 handcrafted levels with increasing difficulty  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf0c Endless Mode for unlimited challenge  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfae Full controller support \u2013 plug and play  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u2728 Simple controls, clean visuals, smooth performance  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of physics-based platformers, retro challenges, and relaxing gameplay loops.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/449160?t=1772963184","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/449160?t=1772963184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/449160/199fa107885b8fe740e9bb3706925c8e573a0ff7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772963184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/449160/199fa107885b8fe740e9bb3706925c8e573a0ff7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772963184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>FIND HMUR!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla